    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっき、何か落ちたの……
ここらへんか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That thing that fell earlier... It landed
somewhere around here, I think?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう……早いよ、&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Jeez... You run
too fast, &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282376</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……って……
ここ、なんか来たことない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Um... Haven't we
been here before?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう言われれば……
そうかも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now that you mention
it... Maybe we have...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルッ！　クルッ！
クルールッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Coulu! Coulu!
Couleur!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれは……&lt;Couleur&gt;！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's... &lt;Couleur&gt;!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282632</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも&lt;Couleur&gt;は、
ここにいるぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But &lt;Couleur&gt;'s
over here, though?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ……
&lt;Couleur&gt;のお兄さん？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then... Maybe it's
&lt;Couleur&gt;'s brother?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Couleur&gt;の姉ちゃんかも
しれねーぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Could be &lt;Couleur&gt;'s
sister, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どっちでもいいよ！
でも、&lt;Couleur&gt;って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Either way's fine!
But, isn't &lt;Couleur&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282896</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あっ、&lt;Couleur&gt;が
行っちゃうよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, &lt;Couleur&gt;'s
running away!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ、おまえ、
行きたいのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's up? You
wanna follow them?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>姉ちゃんと再会できるかも
なんだもんな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, yeah, you might
be able to reunite
with your sister, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……どうする？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...What should we do?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283292</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もちろん……&lt;Couleur&gt;が
お兄さんと会えるんなら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I mean, obviously... If &lt;Couleur&gt;
can meet her brother, then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283340</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>姉ちゃんだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You mean sister, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どっちでもいいってさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Like I just said,
either way's fine.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく、
追いかけてみよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, let's
follow them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あいつ！
やっぱここにいたんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, there they are! You've
been here the whole time, huh!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>追いかけようぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon, let's chase 'em!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
